<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears fall in April.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears fall in April.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears, due to a lack of financing from federal or regional governments,  fell to 10.76 trillion roubles in April from 11.31 trillion roubles in March, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		Apr 28	Mar 24</p>
<p> wage arrears (government)	 10,761	11,305</p>
<p> wage arrears (companies)	  41,860	41,364</p>
<p> wage arrears (total)		52,621	52,669</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
